# Journey: scout sends the activity deck, everyone sends their picks, and the
# plan schedules what the group shares and offers solo picks as add-ons.
# Picks are counted in code; asking for the deck and the plan needs Claude.
members maya leo priya
from destination-chosen

maya: @scout what should we do while we're there?
expect state activity_deck.activities ~ "name"
maya: @scout my picks: 1 yeah, 2 meh
expect scout reacted like
leo: @scout my picks: 1 meh
priya: @scout my picks: 1 yeah, 3 yeah
expect scout ~ "everyone's picks are in"
expect state activity_deck.picks ~ "{"
priya: @scout can you make us a plan?
expect scout ~ "the plan"
expect state itinerary_add_ons ~ "maya"
expect state itinerary_add_ons ~ "priya"
